<p><strong>Returning the median</strong><br>
With the median values at the top of the heaps, returning the median boils =
down to two cases:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>If the total number of elements is even, both median values can be found=
 at the top of each heap. So, we return their sum divided by 2.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>If the total number of elements is odd, the median will be at the top of=
 the <code>left_half</code> heap.</p>
</li>
</ul>
